# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ROOT ISOLATION LAYER
# This branch (sprint-platform) tracks ONLY sprint-platform/.
# The v1 workspace (web-app/, venv/, old planning docs, skills
# config, etc.) is intentionally untracked here so it can NEVER
# be swept into a sprint-platform commit by `git add .`.
# Give v1 its own branch/master when you're ready to commit it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*
!/sprint-platform/
!/.gitignore
